    "description": "Spawns the configured headless coding agent (p-hermann-coders, chosen by config.coderAgent; Claude Code with Claude Opus 5 by default) inside the repository with the goal, principles, decisions, spec and factor practices as its brief and least-privilege tools; then runs the authoritative verify, commits, pushes, opens the pull request and queues verification. The git host token comes from the vault; the coder never sees it.",
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@result",
        "to": "log"
      }
